{
  "sequence_id": "seq_ec05f45d71c43f2c",
  "texts": [
    {
      "id": "PG1:T1",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "The majority are the result of negative energy that flows out of people..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T2",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "The result of a curse..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T3",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "A curse?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T4",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "It doesn't matter if you believe me or not!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T5",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Any- WAY..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T6",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "places where crowds gather, like schools or hospitals..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T7",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "....are susceptible to receiving that energy."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T8",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Pain, regret, humiliation... the more people dwell on bad memories..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T9",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Curse"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T10",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Curse"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T11",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "curse"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T12",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Curse"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T13",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "curse"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T14",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "...the more these places become receptive to those feelings."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T15",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Curse"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T16",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Curse"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T17",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "For that reason, a cursed object is often found at such places as a Talisman."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T18",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "The object you found is such an item."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T19",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "A Talisman?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T1",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Isn't that a good thing? How's that dangerous?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T2",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "A Talisman sounds harmless enough."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T3",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "The more evil placed on a cursed object, the more it defects other causes."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T4",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Using poison to fend off poison."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T5",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "After many years, the seal weakens and the Talisman essentially changes form."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T6",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "then it attracts courses and feeds on them."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T7",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Compared to other cursed objects, the one placed at your school is extremely dangerous and is categorized as special grade."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T8",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Now, before anyone dies..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T9",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "hand it over."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T10",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Like I said, I don't care."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T1",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "She"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T2",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "But you better explain this to my friends!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T3",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "It's empty?!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T4",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "The"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T5",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "What I chased here..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T6",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "...was the cursed energy..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T7",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "...lingering in the box?!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T8",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Where are the Con-Tents?!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T9",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Like I said! The OCCULT research club has it!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T10",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Where do the Mem- bers live?!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T11",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Not sure... some- where over in the 12umi distri..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T12",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T13",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "What's wrong?"
    }
  ],
